; d(angle)/d(time): kona is numerator, time is apeksha
; omega IS angular-frequency — connects directly to oscillation-varga
; apeksha: kramanusara wrt physics-time, held in a sthira (fixed) reference frame

(kosha angular-velocity
  (vishesa rotational-motion-varga oscillation-varga)
  (abheda velocity frequency)
  (yukta kona avrti pi period)
  (swarupa radian)
  (phala angular-acceleration)
  (kramanusara kona)
  (sthita sthira-apeksha))
